{
  "label": "Membuat Rule Pertama",
  "category": "Tutorials",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Membuat Rule Pertama",
      "id": "tutorial-first-rule",
      "intro": "Buat rule deteksi fraud pertama Anda dengan mengikuti langkah-langkah di bawah ini. Kita akan membuat rule GENERAL sederhana: deteksi transfer di atas Rp50.000.000 ke luar negeri.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Buka Halaman Scenario Studio",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik menu **Scenario Studio** di sidebar kiri\n• Lihat daftar rule yang sudah ada (mungkin kosong)\n• Klik **+ Tambah Scenario** di pojok kanan atas",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #eff6ff;\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M4 5a1 1 0 011-1h4a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1V5z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Scenario Studio</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#3b82f6;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">+ Tambah Scenario</span></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Pilih Tipe Rule",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **GENERAL** — 3 langkah, untuk rule sederhana\n• **CONDITION** — 4 langkah, untuk rule kompleks\n• Pilih GENERAL dulu untuk belajar",
          "color": "#f97316",
          "bg": "#fff7ed",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fed7aa;overflow:hidden;padding:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:11px;border:2px solid #f59e0b;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fffbeb,#fff);overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;font-size:10px;color:#475569;text-align:center;\">3 langkah</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:11px;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;overflow:hidden;opacity:.6;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;text-align:center;\">4 langkah</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Isi Parameter Rule (Step 1)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Rule Name** — Nama rule (contoh: Deteksi Transfer Besar ke Luar Negeri)\n• **Risk Score** — Nilai 0-100, makin tinggi makin berbahaya\n• **Priority** — HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW\n• **Active Period** — Jadwal aktif rule (misal: 24/7)",
          "color": "#22c55e",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"width:6px;background:#22c55e;flex-shrink:0;\"></div><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;flex:1;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 15V3m0 12l-4-4m4 4l4-4M2 17l.621 2.485A2 2 0 004.561 21h14.878a2 2 0 001.94-1.515L22 17\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Configure Parameters</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdf4;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#16a34a;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;\">Step 1 of 3</span></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Rule Name</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Deteksi Transfer Besar</div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Risk Score</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#dc2626;\">75</div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Priority</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#dc2626;\">HIGH</div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Active Period</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">24/7</div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Bangun Detection Flow (Step 2)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **CONSTANT** — Field: amount, Operator: >, Value: 50000000\n• **CONTAINS** — Field: destination, Operator: EQUALS, Value: FOREIGN\n• **LOGICAL AND** — Gabungkan kedua kondisi\n• **ALERT** — Hasil akhir kirim alert\n• Hubungkan: Start → CONSTANT → AND → ALERT dan Start → CONTAINS → AND",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#f1f5f9);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #22c55e;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">START</span><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #f59e0b;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">AMOUNT > 50JT</span><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #10b981;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#10b981;\">IS FOREIGN</span><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #6366f1;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">AND</span><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #ef4444;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#ef4444;\">ALERT</span></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Review & Submit (Step 3)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Lihat ringkasan rule (nama, risk score, priority, flow diagram)\n• Periksa node dan konfigurasi yang sudah dibuat\n• Klik **Submit** untuk menyimpan rule sebagai Draft",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;background:#f5f3ff;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd6fe;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Review Summary</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#7c3aed;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;\">Step 3 of 3</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;font-size:10px;color:#475569;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div>Rule: Deteksi Transfer Besar ke Luar Negeri</div><div>Risk: 75 | Priority: HIGH</div><div>Nodes: 4 — Start, 2 Conditions, Alert</div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}